# jdtls compiles here instead of target/ (internal work item 505 / N28), via the root pom's build-directory
# indirection. A language server writing into target/ corrupted ~50% of whole-repo builds (internal work item 411),
# and the pre-PR compile gate plus the mutation receipts both read target/classes.
#
# DEPTH-INDEPENDENT ON PURPOSE. The `target` patterns above are depth-LIMITED (three levels), which
# covers today's tree but silently stops covering a module nested one level deeper. Every one of the
# 47 module poms gets its own target-jdtls/ from the single root edit, so this one is globbed, not
# enumerated.
**/target-jdtls
