# .serena/ — REMOVED 2026-07-22 (internal work item 632 chore lane). Serena is not installed and will not be installed,
# so the tracked .serena/project.yml that pinned languages: [] has nothing left to guard. The pin
# existed to stop a fresh clone starting the Eclipse JDT language server (internal work item 411 — JDT autobuilds into
# the same target/ tree Maven writes to and corrupted ~50% of whole-repo builds). ⚠️ THAT HAZARD IS
# UNCHANGED: if Serena is ever reinstalled here, restore the pin BEFORE the first clone runs, because
# nothing else prevents JDT from starting. internal work item 505/N28 owns the target/-clobber fix itself.
.serena/
# .specify/ — Spec Kit is NOT this repo's process and never was; its files were deleted in N06 S07
# (internal work item 731). This entry stays anyway: a
# stray `specify init` must land untracked rather than stageable, which is the same fail-safe posture
# as .serena/ above.
.specify/

